  switchport
  switchport mode trunk
  switchport trunk allowed vlan 1834-1836,1838-1839,3202,3206

interface port-channel4
  description TRANSPORT-B-LACP
  switchport
  switchport mode trunk
  switchport trunk allowed vlan 1534-1536,1538,1734-1736,1739,1745,2326,3535

